## ✅ Why Use Header? (Short Notes)

* Header is a normal React component
* `Link` does actual routing/navigation
* Header only organizes multiple links
* Makes code clean and reusable
* Easy to manage navigation in large apps
* Same navbar can be used on all pages

---

## ✅ Important Point

> Header is not compulsory for routing.
> It is used for better structure and code management.

---

## ✅ One-Line Interview Answer

> Header is used to organize reusable navigation UI containing multiple Links in a clean and maintainable way.
